    "held_on": "2023-04-30T09:00:00.000Z",
    "question_text": "<p>Consider the following reaction scheme and choose the correct option(s) for the major products <strong>Q, R </strong>and <strong>S</strong>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/6633ace8-4bc9-41f9-9835-a9e5312ffdfc.png\" style=\"width: 489px; height: 179px;\" /></p>",
